# 1_000_000_000 + 1_000_000_000 = 2_000_000_000, under Natural'Last
# (2147483647), so this succeeds. Cheap even at this size: "*"'s binary
# doubling shares subtrees instead of allocating a billion real
# characters -- same intent as RopeTool.Mod's own bigcat, built on
# Ropes."*" instead of Ropes.Mod's Repeat.
program rope_tool
arg bigcat
arg 1000000000
arg x
arg 1000000000
arg y
status 0
output
2000000000
